\documentclass{article}
\begin{document}
\section{Contributions}
Our pipeline for low-resource speech recognition makes three contributions:
\begin{itemize}
\item A self-supervised encoder pretrained on unlabeled audio.
\item A lightweight adapter that transfers the encoder to eight languages.
\item A decoding strategy that reduces word error rate by 12\% relative.
\end{itemize}
\end{document}

